{"id":3401,"slug":"3401-nuxt-3-data-fetching-usefetch-vs-useasyncdata-vs-fetch","category":"Vue.js","subcategory":"SSR & Nuxt","level":"advanced","question_vi":"Nuxt 3 data fetching — useFetch vs useAsyncData vs $fetch?","question_en":"Nuxt 3 data fetching — useFetch vs useAsyncData vs $fetch?","answer_vi":"Nuxt 3 cung cấp 3 data-fetching primitives: `useFetch` (tiện lợi, auto-keyed), `useAsyncData` (linh hoạt, multi-source), và `$fetch` (raw, cho user-triggered actions).\n\n**`useFetch`**: wrapper tiện lợi nhất — tự động deduplicate, cache key từ URL:\n```typescript\n// Chạy cả server lẫn client, SSR-compatible\nconst { data, pending, error, refresh } = await useFetch('/api/users', {\n  lazy: false,     // true = không chặn navigation\n  server: true,    // false = chỉ fetch client-side\n  transform: (data) => data.users,\n})\n```\n\n**`useAsyncData`**: flexible hơn cho custom async logic:\n```typescript\nconst { data } = await useAsyncData('unique-key', async () => {\n  const [users, posts] = await Promise.all([\n    $fetch('/api/users'),\n    $fetch('/api/posts'),\n  ])\n  return { users, posts }\n})\n```\n\n**`$fetch`**: raw fetch (ofetch under the hood) — không tự cache hay deduplicate:\n```typescript\n// Dùng trong event handlers, actions — không trong setup\nasync function submitForm() {\n  const result = await $fetch('/api/users', {\n    method: 'POST', body: formData.value\n  })\n}\n```\n\n**Nguyên tắc chọn nhanh**: setup/navigation data → `useFetch`/`useAsyncData`. User-triggered actions → `$fetch`","answer_en":"**`useFetch`**: convenience wrapper — auto-deduplicates, cache key from URL:\n```typescript\nconst { data, pending, error, refresh } = await useFetch('/api/users', {\n  lazy: false,\n  transform: (d) => d.users,\n})\n```\n\n**`useAsyncData`**: flexible for custom async logic with multiple requests:\n```typescript\nconst { data } = await useAsyncData('key', async () => {\n  const [users, posts] = await Promise.all([$fetch('/api/users'), $fetch('/api/posts')])\n  return { users, posts }\n})\n```\n\n**`$fetch`**: raw ofetch — no auto-caching:\n```typescript\nasync function submit() {\n  const result = await $fetch('/api/users', { method: 'POST', body: form.value })\n}\n```\n\n**Rule**: navigation data → `useFetch`/`useAsyncData`. User actions → `$fetch`.","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Nuxt 3 cung cấp 3 data-fetching primitives: <code>useFetch</code> (tiện lợi, auto-keyed), <code>useAsyncData</code> (linh hoạt, multi-source), và <code>$fetch</code> (raw, cho user-triggered actions).</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong><code>useFetch</code></strong>: wrapper tiện lợi nhất — tự động deduplicate, cache key từ URL:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// Chạy cả server lẫn client, SSR-compatible\nconst { data, pending, error, refresh } = await useFetch('/api/users', {\n  lazy: false,     // true = không chặn navigation\n  server: true,    // false = chỉ fetch client-side\n  transform: (data) =&gt; data.users,\n})\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Chạy cả server lẫn client, SSR-compatible</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> { data, pending, error, refresh } = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">useFetch</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api/users&#x27;</span>, {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">lazy</span>: <span class=\"hljs-literal\">false</span>,     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true = không chặn navigation</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">server</span>: <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span>,    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// false = chỉ fetch client-side</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">transform</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">data</span>) =&gt;</span> data.<span class=\"hljs-property\">users</span>,\n})</code></pre></div><p><strong><code>useAsyncData</code></strong>: flexible hơn cho custom async logic:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const { data } = await useAsyncData('unique-key', async () =&gt; {\n  const [users, posts] = await Promise.all([\n    $fetch('/api/users'),\n    $fetch('/api/posts'),\n  ])\n  return { users, posts }\n})\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> { data } = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">useAsyncData</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;unique-key&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> () =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> [users, posts] = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Promise</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">all</span>([\n    $fetch(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api/users&#x27;</span>),\n    $fetch(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api/posts&#x27;</span>),\n  ])\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> { users, posts }\n})</code></pre></div><p><strong><code>$fetch</code></strong>: raw fetch (ofetch under the hood) — không tự cache hay deduplicate:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// Dùng trong event handlers, actions — không trong setup\nasync function submitForm() {\n  const result = await $fetch('/api/users', {\n    method: 'POST', body: formData.value\n  })\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Dùng trong event handlers, actions — không trong setup</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">submitForm</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> result = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> $fetch(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api/users&#x27;</span>, {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;POST&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">body</span>: formData.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>\n  })\n}</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Nguyên tắc chọn nhanh</strong>: setup/navigation data → <code>useFetch</code>/<code>useAsyncData</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">User-triggered actions → <code>$fetch</code>.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p><strong><code>useFetch</code></strong>: convenience wrapper — auto-deduplicates, cache key from URL:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const { data, pending, error, refresh } = await useFetch('/api/users', {\n  lazy: false,\n  transform: (d) =&gt; d.users,\n})\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> { data, pending, error, refresh } = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">useFetch</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api/users&#x27;</span>, {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">lazy</span>: <span class=\"hljs-literal\">false</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">transform</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">d</span>) =&gt;</span> d.<span class=\"hljs-property\">users</span>,\n})</code></pre></div><p><strong><code>useAsyncData</code></strong>: flexible for custom async logic with multiple requests:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const { data } = await useAsyncData('key', async () =&gt; {\n  const [users, posts] = await Promise.all([$fetch('/api/users'), $fetch('/api/posts')])\n  return { users, posts }\n})\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> { data } = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">useAsyncData</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;key&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> () =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> [users, posts] = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Promise</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">all</span>([$fetch(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api/users&#x27;</span>), $fetch(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api/posts&#x27;</span>)])\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> { users, posts }\n})</code></pre></div><p><strong><code>$fetch</code></strong>: raw ofetch — no auto-caching:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"async function submit() {\n  const result = await $fetch('/api/users', { method: 'POST', body: form.value })\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">submit</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> result = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> $fetch(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api/users&#x27;</span>, { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;POST&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">body</span>: form.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span> })\n}</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Rule</strong>: navigation data → <code>useFetch</code>/<code>useAsyncData</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">User actions → <code>$fetch</code>.</p>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/3200-vue-js-la-gi-khac-react-angular-the-nao","title":"Vue.js là gì? Khác React/Angular thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3201-options-api-vs-composition-api-khac-nhau-gi","title":"Options API vs Composition API — khác nhau gì?"},{"url":"/q/3202-script-setup-la-gi-loi-ich-so-voi-setup-thong-thuong","title":"`<script setup>` là gì? Lợi ích so với `setup()` thông thường?"},{"url":"/q/3204-single-file-component-sfc-la-gi","title":"Single File Component (SFC) là gì?"},{"url":"/q/3205-cac-directive-pho-bien-trong-vue-v-if-v-show-v-for-v-model-v-bind-v-on","title":"Các directive phổ biến trong Vue: v-if, v-show, v-for, v-model, v-bind, v-on?"},{"url":"/q/3206-v-if-vs-v-show-khi-nao-dung-cai-nao","title":"v-if vs v-show — khi nào dùng cái nào?"},{"url":"/q/3207-tai-sao-key-trong-v-for-quan-trong","title":"Tại sao `:key` trong `v-for` quan trọng?"},{"url":"/q/3208-v-model-hoat-dong-the-nao-custom-v-model","title":"v-model hoạt động thế nào? Custom v-model?"}]}